name inter
category Package
revision 58892
shortdesc The inter font face with support for LaTeX, XeLaTeX, and LuaLaTeX
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Inter Sans family of fonts (version 3.015),
longdesc designed by Rasmus Andersson. Inter is a typeface specially
longdesc designed for user interfaces with focus on high legibility of
longdesc small-to-medium sized text on computer screens. The family
longdesc features a tall x-height to aid in readability of mixed-case
longdesc and lower-case text.
execute addMap Inter.map
containersize 6520756
containerchecksum fc423429252eeb8878fc9c423c1c51f9d24781b262d0b4e08d10e397a13985507916d50d3f3fd2164f7fea2c5b45e35da415699e6ed424957c9b337b5e349cfb
